Park development cycle (@park-development-cycle: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @park-development: 1) { r_043BC6V4K9R3X6E9E4TZP3P6J0
**Current owner instruction, 2026-11-20.** Complete one approved source task at a time. Record each completed source step in the [queue](record:r_1FMCTGVHF35B6D0T70JEQAMYDW). Leave deferred work, builds, tests, measurements and reboots for later approval.

**Objective:** prompt daily input and local editing, low CPU/GPU/memory use, minimal freezing/stutter and near-refresh presentation on both outputs with 20–30 varied native items and ordinary applications. Unrelated polish, features and delivery-only work stay deferred.

Read [Overhaul.md](Overhaul.md), its source-only receipts and remaining acceptance, [the checkpoint](record:r_2KDK4ZZZJNBEK0J23TFNQAZF9Y), then the relevant [native task definition](record:r_1FMCTGVHF35B6D0T70JEQAMYDW). Completed implementations are evidence chapters; implemented but unverified reductions are verification-only tasks. Conditional experiments are not a mandate for speculative caches, workers or rewrites. Preserve stable Record identities and unrelated owner edits. Do not use worktrees.

**For the next authorized measurement visit.** Verify the running source revision/profile and the prepared runtime through P156. Use Laboratory report import, source-frame/output linkage, GLES intervals and waits, DRM device/engine deltas, wake attribution and the ranked report. Keep private fixtures, physical daily use, host/GPU/wait costs and collection overhead explicit.

If a later instruction resumes autonomous shipping/rebooting, follow AGENTS.md and save the objective, changes, verification results, expected installed revision and next action before reboot. Reconcile the tree and actual running revision after boot. Startup metadata and old Fiote context do not grant additional authority. Do not open a second Engine against personal data or alter existing directory sync to maintain this plan.

Keep source-identified results and unresolved obligations in the report/checkpoint; close only the deliverable proved. Preserve rejected experiments and limitations without reactivating them as TODOs. After the resumed measurement visit, save evidence, what improved/worsened, missing instrumentation and the ranked next work, following the existing Niri-coding/Park-measurement cycle.

} r_043BC6V4K9R3X6E9E4TZP3P6J0

